<view class="page"><view class="eyebrow">专注写作 / WRITING</view><view class="title">{{title}}</view><view class="subtitle">要求约 {{wordLimit}} 字 · 当前 {{count}} 字</view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}<button class="secondary small" bindtap="copy">复制当前文字</button><button class="secondary small" bindtap="load">重新载入 / 恢复草稿</button></view><block wx:if="{{ready}}"><textarea class="editor" value="{{text}}" bindinput="input" maxlength="30000" disabled="{{busy}}" placeholder="在这里写下你的答案…&#10;&#10;输入会自动保存在本机，并同步到云端。" auto-height cursor-spacing="60" show-confirm-bar="{{false}}"/><view class="save-state">{{saveState}}</view><view class="section">上传作业</view><view class="muted">支持 PDF、DOCX、UTF-8 TXT 和照片；每份最多 5 个文件，单个不超过 10 MB。文字与附件同时提交时，按在线文字进行初批，老师可查看全部附件。</view><view class="grid"><button class="secondary" style="flex:1" bindtap="chooseFile" disabled="{{busy || files.length >= 5}}">选择文件</button><button class="secondary" style="flex:1" bindtap="photo" disabled="{{busy || files.length >= 5}}">拍照 / 图片</button></view><view wx:for="{{files}}" wx:key="id" class="card row"><text>{{item.fileName}}</text><button class="secondary small" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="remove" disabled="{{busy}}">移除</button></view><button class="secondary" bindtap="save" disabled="{{busy}}">立即保存草稿</button><button bindtap="submit" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy || (!count && !files.length)}}">提交给老师</button><view class="notice">离开前可确认“已同步到云端”。断网时保留本机草稿，重新进入可恢复。</view></block></view>